This directory is for grok-generated docs. Separate from human docs; not authoritative vs root docs or `he-said/` quotes.

## Layout

- `he-said/` — **PO quotes** only (plus minimal lock bullets from those quotes).
- Everything else in this folder — assistant status, RCA, bug/todo stack, align logs, implementation notes.

## Index (non-quote)

- `bug-stack.md` — live open/done bug and todo stack
- `answer-vs-defaults.md` — PO answers vs assistant defaults tally
- `phase-0-1-status.md` — Phase 0–1 landed + Batch B questions
- `phase-1.5-notes.md` — period detector implementation / tests
- `tile-status.md` — tile scheduling / quality follow-through
